{
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.26,
   "text": "It was 670K, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 2.44,
   "end": 4.4,
   "text": "And I put 5% down to buy that house."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.68,
   "end": 6.98,
   "text": "Fast forward about a year and a half, two years,"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.12,
   "end": 9.42,
   "text": "that house was worth about 870."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.92,
   "end": 11.56,
   "text": "And so it appreciated quickly."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.72,
   "end": 13.4,
   "text": "And so what I did is I called up the lender and said,"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.46,
   "end": 16.16,
   "text": "hey, I believe that I have 20% ownership in the house."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.16,
   "end": 18.04,
   "text": "It's appreciated significantly, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.2,
   "end": 19.32,
   "text": "Based on these recent comps,"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.32,
   "end": 21.08,
   "text": "they sent an appraiser out to the house."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.22,
   "end": 23.66,
   "text": "They appraised it at a much higher value, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 23.9,
   "end": 25.8,
   "text": "And they dropped that PMI off"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.8,
   "end": 29.96,
   "text": "because they now believe they have 20% equity in the house."
  },
  {
   "start": 30.28,
   "end": 31.72,
   "text": "And so that's how that works real time."
  },
  {
   "start": 31.96,
   "end": 33.46,
   "text": "Now that's not a normal scenario."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.68,
   "end": 35.18,
   "text": "Typically a house is not gonna appreciate"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.76,
   "end": 37.38,
   "text": "30% in a year and a half."
  }
 ],
